(text "OR4_N16: four-input OR, Y = A | B | C | D. Two 6N16B as cathode followers, all four cathodes tied (OR2_N16 widened;\nowner, 2026-10-29, in place of the diode OR4_N16X7). Plates to +150 V; K -> Rs 2.2k || Cs 100p -> Y -> Rk 12k -> -50 V.\nInputs: LV, each from its OWN divider on the driving HV net (470k || 2.7 pF / 200k), never shared with gate grids.\nOutput Y: LV, straight onto gate grids (no divider), never onto another follower or an HV input; fanout 10.\nSimulated, fanout 2/6/10 (input grid -5 V -> load plate 100 V): Y up 26/49/75-90 ns, Y down 54/162/262 ns.\nHeater 6.3 V: 2 x 0.4 A on H1/H2. Page: sch/logic/OR4_N16/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a366b98f-2c91-4789-8bb1-0a3bb84a56d1"))

